{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04997","headline":"送友人任括州 · 沈佺期","name":"送友人任括州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青春浩无际，白日乃迟迟。\n胡爲赏心客，叹迈此芳时。\n瓯粤迫兹守，京阙从此辞。\n茫茫理云帆，草草念行期。\n纷吾结远佩，帐饯出河湄。\n太息东流水，盈觞难再持。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}